flowchart TD
  A[Begin Command Buffer] --> B[Acquire Swapchain Image]
  B --> C[Transition swapchain -> COLOR_ATTACHMENT_OPTIMAL]
  C --> D[Begin Main Render (vkCmdBeginRendering)]
  D --> E{Issue Draws / Submit Draw Calls}
  E --> F1[Branch: G-Buffer Pass (offscreen)]
  E --> F2[Branch: Shadow Map Pass (offscreen)]
  E --> F3[Branch: SSAO / Motion Vectors (offscreen)]
  F1 --> G1[End G-Buffer Pass]
  F2 --> G2[End Shadow Pass]
  F3 --> G3[End SSAO Pass]
  G1 --> H1[Barrier: G-Buffer write -> SHADER_READ_ONLY_OPTIMAL]
  G2 --> H2[Barrier: Shadow write -> SHADER_READ_ONLY_OPTIMAL]
  G3 --> H3[Barrier: SSAO write -> SHADER_READ_ONLY_OPTIMAL]
  H1 --> I[Lighting / Composite Pass (samples offscreen)]
  H2 --> I
  H3 --> I
  I --> J[Optional Post-process Passes]
  J --> K[Transition final image -> PRESENT_SRC_KHR]
  K --> L[End Command Buffer / vkQueueSubmit]
  L --> M[vkQueuePresentKHR]
